00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:09.370
So, let's move on to something

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:12.670
that is a little bit more
fun and lighthearted.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:13.503
Murder!

00:00:13.503 --> 00:00:15.219
(drum music)
